Error [E0114]: When `flag` is false, `maybe` reaches the end without a value
  --> classic_if_without_else_does_not_satisfy_missing_return_check.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     if flag { return 1 }
    |     ^^
 Why: A block that promises Int must end with a value of that type, or leave through `return` on every path
 Fix: Add a last line that produces Int for that case, or turn the last guard into an `else`
